><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260227111720-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260227111840-05'00'" name="7ef17459-e623-4cc5-90fb-fafec4fd84da" page="1" coords="266.400000,615.882000,543.500000,615.882000,266.400000,605.225000,543.500000,605.225000,266.400000,605.632000,444.204000,605.632000,266.400000,594.975000,444.204000,594.975000" rect="266.067000,594.642000,543.833000,616.215000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kristan Blackhart"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This is presented as fact in both reports, but the declines are not fully understood. Some people may only look at the graphical summary, so precise language is important.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="1" rect="408.727000,485.302000,592.654000,616.211000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#068A1C" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260302142537-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260302142652-05'00'" name="c15a0946-2cd9-4e64-8760-ece7d5df310a" page="1" coords="77.101900,532.524000,109.839000,532.524000,77.101900,519.291000,109.839000,519.291000" rect="76.688400,518.877000,110.253000,532.937000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Amanda Hart"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Include MAFMC to be consistent with prior section objective language</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="583.885000,436.729000,768.353000,532.379000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#068A1C" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260302144718-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260302144734-05'00'" name="298efe80-d2c6-496c-9f70-b889efbff487" page="1" coords="266.400000,496.385000,388.862000,496.385000,266.400000,485.728000,388.862000,485.728000" rect="266.067000,485.395000,389.195000,496.718000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Amanda Hart"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Seems to contradict trend icon</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="1" rect="612.000000,404.385000,796.000000,496.385000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260223095235-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260223095441-05'00'" name="ab5135c5-8bd0-4e13-8201-c3819bae76db" page="1" coords="304.212000,365.396000,457.112000,365.396000,304.212000,354.738000,457.112000,354.738000" rect="303.879000,354.405000,457.445000,365.729000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>A shift how? The other sentences might imply that there is just less participation. A more descriptive word than shift might add additional clarity</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="545.727000,224.936000,729.668000,365.257000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260223095553-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260223095603-05'00'" name="ca558ed7-11de-4bd2-b533-26bd7a76c18b" page="1" coords="491.546000,319.899000,546.396000,319.899000,491.546000,309.241000,546.396000,309.241000,266.400000,309.651000,313.770000,309.651000,266.400000,298.993000,313.770000,298.993000" rect="266.067000,298.660000,546.729000,320.232000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>should be "towards a lower trophic level"?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.000000,227.899000,796.000000,319.899000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260220094627-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260220094724-05'00'" name="415b5da1-394b-4541-88f0-f073ecb8d241" page="1" coords="266.400000,580.632000,312.810000,580.632000,266.400000,569.975000,312.810000,569.975000" rect="266.067000,569.642000,313.143000,580.965000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Chris Legault"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Inconsistent use of a hyphen or not in Mid Atlantic (e.g., see Commercial profits second sentence).</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.003000,471.926000,795.931000,580.581000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260220095036-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260220095219-05'00'" name="e3bee49a-bc27-4fbf-8532-756fe9361517" page="1" coords="320.766000,546.382000,428.380000,546.382000,320.766000,535.725000,428.380000,535.725000" rect="320.433000,535.392000,428.713000,546.715000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Chris Legault"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This wording does not appear consistent with the declining trend symbol shown to the left. My guess is that there are two time periods being used, a shorter one for the remains near statement and a longer one for the declining trend. Not sure how to get around this, or if need to, just wanted to point out what could be seen as an inconsistency.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.003000,371.125000,795.931000,546.544000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260220095531-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260220095746-05'00'" name="68a5ac3c-6d8f-43e9-8473-655f4cfcc307" page="1" coords="266.400000,385.897000,540.727000,385.897000,266.400000,375.240000,540.727000,375.240000" rect="266.067000,374.907000,541.060000,386.230000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Chris Legault"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This is just a mathematical artifact of the declines in state-managed species and scallops, right? The commercial profits section above indicates declining profits for managed species in the region. So the managed species are not declining as fast as the state-managed species and scallops, making the managed species a larger proportion of the total - or am I misinterpreting something? If this is correct, perhaps replace contribution with proportion to make it a bit more clear?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.003000,177.379000,795.931000,386.180000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260220101313-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260220101359-05'00'" name="ac485daa-448a-46d6-8238-c2219f18e45c" page="1" coords="412.953000,521.382000,444.878000,521.382000,412.953000,510.725000,444.878000,510.725000" rect="412.620000,510.392000,445.211000,521.715000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Chris Legault"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Figure 3 shows moderate risk and the text on page 8 says moderate to high risk. Is high risk appropriate here?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.003000,413.017000,795.931000,521.672000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260219110103-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260219110107-05'00'" name="7752616e-9fa6-4554-851c-186dd0867b2f" page="1" coords="266.400000,640.882000,287.156000,640.882000,266.400000,630.225000,287.156000,630.225000" rect="266.067000,629.892000,287.489000,641.215000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kiersten L Curti"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>2024 or 2025?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="1" rect="612.000000,548.882000,796.000000,640.882000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260225141717-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260225141743-05'00'" name="b1083128-657d-4058-ae7c-9a8836137b32" page="1" coords="486.737000,496.382000,517.052000,496.382000,486.737000,485.725000,517.052000,485.725000" rect="486.404000,485.392000,517.385000,496.715000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Samantha.L.Werner"
