><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260227111051-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260227111102-05'00'" name="8a2242f4-2281-4068-bb3b-616daec1b50c" page="2" coords="139.822000,479.742000,199.232000,479.742000,139.822000,467.136000,199.232000,467.136000,54.000000,466.542000,275.372000,466.542000,54.000000,453.936000,275.372000,453.936000,54.000000,453.342000,291.254000,453.342000,54.000000,440.736000,291.254000,440.736000,54.000000,440.142000,286.362000,440.142000,54.000000,427.536000,286.362000,427.536000,54.000000,426.942000,133.215000,426.942000,54.000000,414.336000,133.215000,414.336000" rect="53.606100,413.942000,291.648000,480.136000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kristan Blackhart"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.6pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The language here might be reconsidered. It reads as if changes are well understood and it's a simple decision to consider them, or not. That's not an accurate description of the situation and the NEFSC should do a better job of managing expectations with our partners.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="2" rect="408.727000,315.196000,592.654000,479.486000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260220100225-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260220100240-05'00'" name="fb666654-3449-4e1c-96db-9105ed5a6e78" page="2" coords="443.962000,234.016000,549.155000,234.016000,443.962000,224.848000,549.155000,224.848000,450.682000,224.416000,528.225000,224.416000,450.682000,215.248000,528.225000,215.248000" rect="443.676000,214.962000,549.442000,234.303000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Chris Legault"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>If the forecasts are initialized with current conditions, why don't the dots lie on top of th GLORYS line?&#xD;(same comment as in the New England SOE)</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="2" rect="612.003000,103.415000,795.931000,234.325000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260219112640-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260219112713-05'00'" name="596fc36a-e8ac-43de-a2bf-89964940c6c2" page="2" coords="137.335000,603.842000,234.980000,603.842000,137.335000,591.236000,234.980000,591.236000,54.000000,590.642000,248.349000,590.642000,54.000000,578.036000,248.349000,578.036000,54.000000,577.442000,135.864000,577.442000,54.000000,564.836000,135.864000,564.836000" rect="53.606100,564.442000,248.743000,604.236000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kiersten L Curti"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Am I correct that mis-allocation could also lead to F's potentially higher than the recommended values in some areas?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="2" rect="476.859000,495.621000,661.005000,603.840000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260225140954-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260225141006-05'00'" name="f88320aa-08f1-44c4-ab79-3018afeecd13" page="3" coords="405.480000,619.480000,575.066000,619.480000,405.480000,606.874000,575.066000,606.874000" rect="405.086000,606.480000,575.460000,619.874000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Cameron Hodgdon"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>distribution and timing should both be plural.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="3" rect="612.129000,522.197000,796.055000,619.724000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260223101538-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260223101604-05'00'" name="2ac42ddc-32ad-481f-a630-b82c24ff68c7" page="3" coords="333.000000,659.080000,410.337000,659.080000,333.000000,646.474000,410.337000,646.474000" rect="332.606000,646.080000,410.731000,659.474000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
