><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This is not a complete sentence as written, recommend deleting the "As".  Also, if I am counting the years correctly, it looks like the shift occurred in 2024 and 2025, not 2023</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="38" rect="612.000000,310.832000,796.000000,402.832000"
/></highlight
