><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Why the separate trend of the recent series for Haddock GB? </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.6pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
> How were these years decided as a recent series?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
