><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-17.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This is true, but it may also be worth noting here than the 2025 management track stock assessment for SNEMA yellowtail flounder has included an effect of the Gulf Stream Index on recruitment (outperformed the cold pool index in that assessment).</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
