><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>I don't see this figure referenced anywhere and its a little confusing to have year as a factor and on the x axis. Consider removing or explaining in a paragraph?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="58" rect="583.854000,274.582000,768.436000,393.055000"
