><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260219113326-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260219113414-05'00'" name="6926fbd4-a36a-4ada-ac2d-b873adbd1148" page="64" coords="472.490000,562.773000,555.310000,562.773000,472.490000,548.656000,555.310000,548.656000,56.693000,550.818000,228.875000,550.818000,56.693000,536.701000,228.875000,536.701000" rect="56.251800,536.260000,555.751000,563.214000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kiersten L Curti"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Unclear.  I assume this is referring to salinity?  If so, would it be helpful to add a figure?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="64" rect="462.360000,454.729000,646.506000,562.947000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#FF6200" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260302082122-05'00'" flags="print" date="D:20260302082122-05'00'" name="c074f7d1-8054-4c29-86ed-0a424f45e7f3" page="65" coords="241.126000,439.612000,259.557000,439.612000,241.126000,426.880000,259.557000,426.880000" rect="240.728000,426.482000,259.955000,440.010000" subject="Highlight" title="Kristan Blackhart"
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="65" rect="612.000000,347.612000,796.000000,439.612000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260224155604-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260224155659-05'00'" name="94ae8567-f77b-40fa-ba67-4a3435762ff6" page="65" coords="101.639000,450.571000,540.131000,450.571000,101.639000,437.839000,540.131000,437.839000,56.693000,439.612000,259.557000,439.612000,56.693000,426.880000,259.557000,426.880000" rect="56.295100,426.482000,540.529000,450.969000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Are these the only two sources? If so, I'd expect these lines to be mirrors of each other. And since they're not, I'm curious what the other source is. And what the magnitude of the contributions actually are, if that's possible to measure</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="65" rect="612.000000,312.546000,795.927000,450.655000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260224155806-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260224155852-05'00'" name="5ba2f633-a9c5-41c8-ae4c-c3114f0d1b12" page="65" coords="218.507000,360.726000,222.381000,360.726000,218.507000,346.609000,222.381000,346.609000" rect="218.066000,346.168000,222.822000,361.167000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Should be "of" total production? Otherwise should be something like "contributes a significant proportion to..."</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="65" rect="612.000000,253.964000,795.927000,360.655000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#FF6200" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260302082204-05'00'" flags="print" date="D:20260302082204-05'00'" name="ba7b1bae-8b4c-4953-872b-718ebb44152e" page="66" coords="199.717000,153.681000,555.307000,153.681000,199.717000,139.564000,555.307000,139.564000,56.693000,141.726000,555.313000,141.726000,56.693000,127.609000,555.313000,127.609000,56.693000,129.770000,555.312000,129.770000,56.693000,115.653000,555.312000,115.653000,56.693000,117.815000,555.308000,117.815000,56.693000,103.698000,555.308000,103.698000,56.693000,105.860000,555.304000,105.860000,56.693000,91.743100,555.304000,91.743100,56.693000,93.905000,555.310000,93.905000,56.693000,79.788100,555.310000,79.788100,56.693000,81.950000,555.308000,81.950000,56.693000,67.833100,555.308000,67.833100,56.693000,69.995000,555.309000,69.995000,56.693000,55.878100,555.309000,55.878100,301.019000,54.199000,310.982000,54.199000,301.019000,40.082100,310.982000,40.082100" rect="56.251800,39.640900,555.754000,154.122000" subject="Highlight" title="Kristan Blackhart"
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="66" rect="612.000000,61.681000,796.000000,153.681000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260224173019-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260224173052-05'00'" name="c1f537e7-2747-49f7-803f-58c8c900fc55" page="66" coords="199.717000,153.681000,206.325000,153.681000,199.717000,139.564000,206.325000,139.564000" rect="199.276000,139.123000,206.766000,154.122000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Emily Liljestrand"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>I'd suggest changing this format. The dashes are confusing, I assume they are M dashes that split out clauses but then they aren't. Maybe replace with numbers or put these on individual lines</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="66" rect="612.001000,25.962900,795.928000,153.599000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260219113926-05'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260219113938-05'00'" name="509e9918-96dd-4039-a600-104e445fe276" page="66" coords="87.718600,273.233000,227.303000,273.233000,87.718600,259.116000,227.303000,259.116000" rect="87.277400,258.675000,227.744000,273.674000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Kiersten L Curti"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Unclear, suggest rewording</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
